OL,3,GNEWSAArson ravaged venue 'made me who I
OL,4,Aam - and its name will live on'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor professional boxer Bradley
OL,7,FGoldsmith, watching flames tear through
OL,8,Fthe Standard Triumph Club this week
OL,9,Ffelt like losing a piece of his
OL,10,Fchildhood.
OL,12,FThe 28-year-old, who now holds the
OL,13,FInternational Boxing Federation (IBF)
OL,14,FInternational Middleweight title, spent
OL,15,Fmore than a decade boxing at the Tile
OL,16,FHill Lane venue after first walking
OL,17,Fthrough its doors as an eight-year-old
OL,18,Fboy.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
